#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn what Ubuntu Desktop is, what it can do, how it differs from other "
"operating systems and whether it's the right choice for you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:8
msgid "About Ubuntu Desktop"
msgstr "關於 Ubuntu Desktop"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:10
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop is the most popular open-source operating system powering "
"millions of PCs and laptops around the world."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 是全球最受歡迎的開源作業系統，為數百萬台個人電腦與筆記型電腦提"
"供動力。"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:12
msgid "What can it do?"
msgstr "它能做什麼？"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:14
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop supports all your daily computing needs. It offers "
"applications for web browsing, messaging, gaming and content creation, "
"including Firefox, Chrome, Discord, Steam and OBS Studio. It's a primary "
"platform for all major IDEs, game development tools and AI/ML software."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 支援您所有的日常運算需求。它提供網頁瀏覽、即時通訊、遊戲和內容"
"創作的應用程式，包括 Firefox、Chrome、Discord、Steam 和 OBS Studio。它是所有"
"主要 IDE、遊戲開發工具以及 AI／ML 軟體的主要平台。"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:16
msgid "How is it different?"
msgstr "它有什麼不同？"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:18
msgid ""
"Compared to other mainstream operating systems, Ubuntu Desktop prioritizes "
"your privacy and security. It's free to download, use, modify and share. "
"Compared to other Linux-based systems, Ubuntu Desktop aims to make open-"
"source software easy and pleasant to use. Thanks to regular releases and "
"commercial support, Ubuntu Desktop is a reliable and predictable platform."
msgstr ""
"與其他主流作業系統相比，Ubuntu Desktop 優先考慮您的隱私與安全。它可以免費下"
"載、使用、修改和分享。與其他基於 Linux 的系統相比，Ubuntu Desktop 旨在讓開源"
"軟體變得簡單且易於使用。得益於定期的發行版本和商業支援，Ubuntu Desktop 是一個"
"可靠且可預測的平台。"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:20
msgid "Is it for me?"
msgstr "它適合我嗎？"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:22
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop is used by millions of users at home, for development and in "
"enterprise. Anyone with a laptop or a PC is welcome to use Ubuntu Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 被數百萬名使用者用於居家、開發及企業環境。歡迎任何擁有筆記型電"
"腦或個人電腦的使用者使用 Ubuntu Desktop。"

#: ../../../explanation/about-ubuntu-desktop.md:24
msgid ""
"If you aren't sure, you can try Ubuntu Desktop without making any permanent "
"changes on your computer: {ref}`run it from a USB stick <try-ubuntu-"
"desktop>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您還不確定，可以先嘗試 Ubuntu Desktop 而不對電腦進行任何永久性更改：{ref}"
"`直接從 USB 隨身碟執行即可 <try-ubuntu-desktop>`。"
